message: "If you use this project, please cite this repository and identify the commit used."
type: software
title: "VAERS Signal Prioritization"
authors:
  - family-names: Alpay
    given-names: Natanael
    affiliation: "University of California, Irvine"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-08
repository-code: "https://github.com/AlpayNatanael/VAERS-Signal-Prioritization"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible retrospective ranking of vaccine-type and MedDRA event-term
  pairs for next-quarter statistical threshold crossings in VAERS.
  Includes chronological logistic regression and gradient boosting fits,
  historical baselines, tie-aware evaluation, an executed presentation
  notebook, frozen aggregate inputs, and a research poster.
keywords:
  - VAERS
  - pharmacovigilance
  - machine learning
  - temporal validation
  - reproducible research
